0], "flags": {}, "order": 18, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "link": 29}, {"name": "vae", "type": "VAE", "link": 30}], "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "links": [31], "slot_index": 0}], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeTiled"}, "widgets_values": [512, 64, 64, 8]}, {"id": 9, "type": "SaveImage", "title": "Image finale 2048", "pos": [2380, 420], "size": [560, 600], "flags": {}, "order": 19, "mode": 0, "inputs": [{"name": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "link": 31}], "outputs": [], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "widgets_values": ["SDXL"]}, {"type": "MarkdownNote", "size": [440, 360], "flags": {}, "mode": 0, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "title": "Mode d'emploi", "id": 23, "pos": [-460, 20], "order": 0, "widgets_values": ["**SDXL texte → image (base + refiner, upscale x2)**\n\n1. Décrire l'image dans **Prompt positif** (en anglais : sujet → action → décor → lumière → style).\n2. Ce qu'on ne veut pas dans **Prompt négatif**.\n3. Ctrl+Entrée → aperçu 1024 (≈ 16 s), puis image finale 2048 `output\\SDXL_*.png` (≈ 52 s sur RX 9070).\n\nRéglages :\n- Taille (*Taille de l'image*) : rester vers 1 Mpx (1024×1024, 1216×832, 832×1216, 1344×768…).\n- Explorer vite : sélectionner les nœuds de l'upscale → **Ctrl+B** (désactivés) → ≈ 16 s par image.\n- Garder une image : passer le `noise_seed` du nœud *Base* en **fixed**, puis réactiver l'upscale."]}], "links": [[1, 4, 0, 3, 0, "MODEL"], [2, 5, 0, 3, 3, "LATENT"], [3, 4, 1, 6, 0, "CLIP"], [4, 6, 0, 3, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [5, 4, 1, 7, 0, "CLIP"], [6, 7, 0, 3, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [7, 15, 0, 8, 0, "LATENT"], [8, 4, 2, 8, 1, "VAE"], [9, 8, 0, 22, 0, "IMAGE"], [10, 10, 0, 6, 1, "STRING"], [11, 11, 0, 7, 1, "STRING"], [12, 10, 0, 12, 1, "STRING"], [13, 11, 0, 13, 1, "STRING"], [14, 14, 0, 15, 0, "MODEL"], [15, 14, 1, 12, 0, "CLIP"], [16, 14, 1, 13, 0, "CLIP"], [17, 12, 0, 15, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [18, 13, 0, 15, 2, "COND